# Python (agent tooling)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Machine-local agent scratch. `.omo/run-continuation` holds per-session resume
# state and `.workbuddy-ai` holds per-run artifacts and memory; both are written
# by local tooling, differ per machine, and nothing in the build reads them.
.omo/
.workbuddy-ai/

# `vendor/reui-atlas` is a local checkout of the ReUI reference app, kept for
# reading component sources while adopting ReUI blocks. Nothing imports it and
# no build step reads it, so it stays out of the repository until someone
# decides it should ship — `packages/views/**` tests already skip `vendor/reui-*`
# in the type-scale guard, so tracking it later needs no other change.
vendor/
